AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175#699ba5abbb5b62c3642986b8c2d07c78-555558bff663a80f54c7410408b75d07> "http://example.org/x#B in taxon http://example.org/x#T")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175#699ba5abbb5b62c3642986b8c2d07c78-555558bff663a80f54c7410408b75d07> <http://example.org/x#B>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175#699ba5abbb5b62c3642986b8c2d07c78-555558bff663a80f54c7410408b75d07> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 <http://example.org/x#T>))


DisjointClasses(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 <http://example.org/x#A>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 <http://example.org/x#B>))
